 "difference_id": "Tc1b40c54",
 "property_summary": "For every call to transfer(...) the reference contract always reverts when the _tos array is empty, but the mutant that uses require(_tos.length >= 0) will accept an empty _tos and return true (i.e., the reference always reverts on empty _tos while the mutant does not).",
